# Security headers for every static-asset response (Workers Static Assets
# reads this file from the assets directory). Kept deliberately minimal for a
# marketing site: nosniff stops MIME confusion, the referrer policy trims
# outbound leakage, the permissions policy declares we use no sensitive APIs,
# and frame-ancestors 'none' blocks clickjacking (supersedes X-Frame-Options).
# HSTS is NOT set here on purpose — enable it on the Cloudflare zone (edge)
# once alex-motors.ie is live, so the whole domain is covered consistently.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=()
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
